  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/045J">Lemma <span data-tag="045J">10.163.3</span>.</a> Let $R \to S$ be a flat local homomorphism of local Noetherian rings. Then the following are equivalent </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
$S$ is Cohen-Macaulay, and 
</p>
</li><li><p>
$R$ and $S/\mathfrak m_ RS$ are Cohen-Macaulay. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
